{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.GarnirShapeCard","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GarnirShapeCard","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.GarnirShape","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedPartitionShape","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionLexWellFounded"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GarnirShapeCard.lexGtOn_garnirPartOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GarnirShapeCard.lexGtOn_garnirPartOf","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GarnirShapeCard.lean#L103-L111","doc":"**The Garnir step drops the shape in the well-founded order 3.14 inducts along.**\n\nThis is the composition the whole file exists for: `garnirShape_lexGt` gives a lex-greater\nshape, `card_garnirShape` puts it at the same size, and `lexGtOn` is where 3.14's outer\ninduction lives. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GarnirShapeCard.garnirPartOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GarnirShapeCard.garnirPartOf","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GarnirShapeCard.lean#L97-L101","doc":"The Garnir shape, packaged as a member of `PartOf n` — the form\n`PartitionLexWellFounded.lexGtOn` consumes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GarnirShapeCard.card_garnirShape","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GarnirShapeCard.card_garnirShape","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GarnirShapeCard.lean#L89-L95","doc":"**The Garnir shape preserves size.**  This is the connector: it lets\n`GarnirShape.garnirShape_lexGt` be fed to `PartitionLexWellFounded.lexGtOn`, which is\ndefined on shapes of one fixed size. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GarnirShapeCard.sum_garnirComp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GarnirShapeCard.sum_garnirComp","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GarnirShapeCard.lean#L61-L87","doc":"**The Garnir composition has the same total as the shape it came from.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GarnirShapeCard.sum_sortDesc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GarnirShapeCard.sum_sortDesc","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GarnirShapeCard.lean#L57-L59","doc":"Sorting does not move a sum. ","signatureChunk":0}]}